# NetBee OS - WAN Hotplug Hook
# Built-in RPi 5 RP1 Ethernet (macb=y) always probes first as eth0 (LAN),
# while external USB/PCIe NICs load as modules (=m) for WAN.
# Trigger vnstat & offload/SQM automatically when the configured WAN NIC is hotplugged.
SUBSYSTEM=="net", ACTION=="add", KERNEL!="lo", KERNEL!="ifb*", KERNEL!="wg*", RUN+="/usr/sbin/netbee-hotplug-wan %k"
